<title>FRANCE: Algeria's Etterkib firm posts 7.6 mln dinar profit.</title>
<headline>Algeria's Etterkib firm posts 7.6 mln dinar profit.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria's machinery assembling enterprise Etterkib showed a 7.6 million dinars ($140,000) profit in 1995, the official Algerian news agency APS said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The joint-stock company has 120 million dinars in assets and is based in Blida, 50 km (30 miles) south of Algiers, said APS without giving comparative figures.</p>
<p>($1= 54 dinars)</p>
</text>
